    "contentHTML": "\n<div class=\"learn-intro\">\n  The field of <span class=\"learn-keyword\">Food and Nutrition</span> offers a wide range of rewarding career paths. As awareness of the importance of healthy eating grows and the food industry expands, professionals with expertise in food and nutrition are in increasing demand across healthcare, education, industry, and hospitality.\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">1. Careers in Food and Nutrition</h3>\n<div class=\"learn-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"learn-table\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Career</th><th>Description</th><th>Work Setting</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Teaching/Education</td><td>Teaching Food and Nutrition at secondary and tertiary levels</td><td>Schools, polytechnics, universities</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Dietetics</td><td>Assessing and treating nutrition-related health problems; planning therapeutic diets</td><td>Hospitals, clinics, public health agencies</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Food Science and Technology</td><td>Research and development of food products; food quality and safety</td><td>Food manufacturing companies, research institutes</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Food Engineering</td><td>Designing and managing food processing equipment and plants</td><td>Food processing factories, engineering firms</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Community Nutrition</td><td>Planning and implementing nutrition programmes for communities and public health</td><td>Government health agencies, NGOs, international organisations (WHO, UNICEF)</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Clinical Nutrition</td><td>Providing nutritional support for patients with diseases; enteral and parenteral nutrition</td><td>Hospitals, intensive care units</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Hotel and Catering Management</td><td>Managing food and beverage services in hotels, restaurants, and catering establishments</td><td>Hotels, restaurants, event venues, airlines</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Public Health Nutrition</td><td>Developing nutrition policies and programmes at national/international level</td><td>Federal Ministry of Health, WHO, UNICEF, NGOs</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Food Quality Control</td><td>Ensuring food products meet safety and quality standards</td><td>NAFDAC, SON, food companies</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">2. Educational Requirements</h3>\n<ul class=\"learn-list\">\n  <li>Most careers require at least a B.Sc. in Food Science and Technology, Human Nutrition, Dietetics, or a related field</li>\n  <li>Some specialisations (clinical nutrition, dietetics) require professional registration and practising licences</li>\n  <li>Advanced research careers require postgraduate degrees (M.Sc., Ph.D.)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">3. Professional Bodies in Nigeria</h3>\n<ul class=\"learn-list\">\n  <li><strong>Nutrition Society of Nigeria (NSN)</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Dietitians Association of Nigeria (DAN)</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Institute of Food Science and Technology of Nigeria (IFSTN)</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>NAFDAC</strong> (National Agency for Food and Drug Administration and Control) — regulates food safety</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">💡</span>\n  <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> Know the distinction between DIETETICS (clinical, treats nutrition-related diseases in hospital setting) and COMMUNITY NUTRITION (population-level nutrition programmes). CLINICAL NUTRITION = hospital-based patient nutrition support. FOOD SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY = research and development of food products in the food industry.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">🎯</span>\n  <strong>Summary:</strong> Careers: Teaching, Dietetics (hospital), Food Science and Technology (food industry), Food Engineering (processing plants), Community Nutrition (public health), Clinical Nutrition (hospital patients), Hotel and Catering Management, Public Health Nutrition, Food Quality Control. All require relevant university education. Professional bodies: NSN, DAN, IFSTN.\n</div>\n  ",
