    "contentHTML": "\n<div class=\"learn-intro\">\n  A well-planned kitchen and properly maintained equipment are essential for efficient, safe, and hygienic food preparation. Understanding <span class=\"learn-keyword\">kitchen design principles</span>, types of equipment, and the care of kitchen tools ensures that cooking is safe, enjoyable, and produces nutritious meals.\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">1. Kitchen Planning Principles</h3>\n<p class=\"learn-p\">A good kitchen layout should follow the <strong>work triangle principle</strong> — the three main work centres (storage/refrigerator, preparation/sink, and cooking/stove) should form a triangle for efficient movement:</p>\n<ul class=\"learn-list\">\n  <li><strong>Storage area:</strong> Food storage, refrigerator, dry goods storage</li>\n  <li><strong>Preparation area:</strong> Sink, chopping surface, mixing area</li>\n  <li><strong>Cooking area:</strong> Stove, oven, microwave</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">2. Factors in Kitchen Planning</h3>\n<ul class=\"learn-list\">\n  <li>Adequate space for movement and safety</li>\n  <li>Good ventilation (windows, extractor fan) to remove steam, smoke, and cooking odours</li>\n  <li>Adequate lighting for safe food preparation</li>\n  <li>Safe electrical connections and gas fittings</li>\n  <li>Easy-to-clean surfaces (tiles, smooth countertops)</li>\n  <li>Adequate water supply and drainage</li>\n  <li>Storage for equipment and ingredients</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">3. Large/Fixed Kitchen Equipment</h3>\n<div class=\"learn-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"learn-table\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Equipment</th><th>Function</th><th>Care</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Cooker/Stove</td><td>Cooking food by gas or electricity</td><td>Clean after each use; check burners and connections</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Oven</td><td>Baking, roasting, and grilling</td><td>Clean inside regularly; check temperature accuracy</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Refrigerator</td><td>Preserving food by cold storage</td><td>Defrost regularly; clean inside; maintain correct temperature (0-4°C)</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Freezer</td><td>Long-term food preservation at sub-zero temperatures</td><td>Defrost, clean; maintain -18°C or below</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Food processor/blender</td><td>Blending, grinding, slicing food</td><td>Wash blades carefully; ensure dry before storage</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">4. Small/Moveable Utensils and Labour-Saving Devices</h3>\n<div class=\"learn-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"learn-table\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Examples</th><th>Function</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Measuring tools</td><td>Measuring cups, spoons, weighing scales, measuring jugs</td><td>Accurate measurement of ingredients</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Cutting tools</td><td>Chef's knife, paring knife, chopping board, scissors</td><td>Cutting, slicing, chopping food</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Mixing tools</td><td>Bowls, spoons, whisks, spatulas, electric mixer</td><td>Combining, beating, mixing ingredients</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Cooking pots</td><td>Saucepans, frying pans, pressure cookers, cooking pots</td><td>Heating and cooking food</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Straining tools</td><td>Colander, sieve, strainer</td><td>Draining water from cooked food</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Labour-saving devices</td><td>Electric blender, food processor, electric can opener, dishwasher</td><td>Reduce time and effort in food preparation</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">💡</span>\n  <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> Work triangle principle = refrigerator + sink + stove forming a triangle for efficient kitchen movement. Refrigerator temperature = 0-4°C (fridge) and -18°C (freezer). LABOUR-SAVING DEVICES reduce physical effort and time (blender, food processor, dishwasher). Good kitchen: ventilation, lighting, clean surfaces, water supply, safe electrical/gas fittings.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">🎯</span>\n  <strong>Summary:</strong> Kitchen planning: work triangle (storage-preparation-cooking), ventilation, lighting, safety, easy-to-clean surfaces. Equipment: stove, oven, refrigerator (0-4°C), freezer (-18°C), blender. Small utensils: measuring tools, cutting tools, mixing tools, cooking pots, straining tools, labour-saving devices. Care: clean after use, maintain correctly.\n</div>\n  ",
